Destabilize your glyphs, triggering every glyph in radius 10 with an enemy standing on it.

At talent level 2 glyphs triggered this way will leave a residue of themselves on the ground, dealing damage each turn for [0, 1, 2, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

Sunlight:  [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage.

Moonlight:  [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage.

Twilight:  [20, 27, 33, 37, 41 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light and [20, 27, 33, 37, 41 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage
